F.. CLOSED SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 City Attorney Quinn Barrow announced the following Closed Session: \i0\fs24\par
\cf1\fs22\par
}


I.. ANNOUNCEMENT IN OPEN SESSION OF ITEMS TO BE DISCUSSED IN CLOSED SESSION

a.. CONFERENCE WITH LEGAL COUNSEL (INITIATION OF LITIGATION)
(Government Code Section 54956.9(d)(4))

Based upon existing facts and circumstances, the City Council will be
considering joining as amicus in the case of New Commune DTLA, LLC. 
et. al. v City of Redondo Beach (Case No. 22TRCP00203) as an amicus curiae.

II.. RECESS INTO CLOSED SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 4:32 PM, the City Council recessed into Closed Session.\i0\fs24\par
\cf1\fs22\par
}


III.. RECONVENE INTO OPEN SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 6:00 PM, the City Council reconvened into Open Session with all City Councilmembers present. \i0\fs24\par
\cf1\fs22\par
}


IV.. CLOSED SESSION ANNOUNCEMENT IN OPEN SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\i\fs22 City Attorney Quinn Barrow announced that the City Council went into Closed Session to discuss three items identified on the agenda. With respect to Item a, the City Council authorized supporting Redondo Beach in the lawsuit identified on the agenda. With respect to Item b, the City Council gave direction to the City Attorney. There was no other reportable action taken.\i0\fs24\par
\pard\cf1\fs22\par
}


G.. ADJOURNMENT {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 6:01 PM, Mayor Lesser adjourned the meeting.\i0\fs24\par
\cf1\fs22\par
}


